title Spike 21: zone size and metal
about An 8v8 of bots on a huge zone: 2048 across with 256 metal spots, four times as wide as a standard one. Room for sixteen players to expand. 8x.

scenario economy
map huge
players blue 8
players red 8
clip 0..7200
speed 8
camera 760,1100 1750

# Observed: by 4 minutes 57 and 62 extractors (7 a player; a standard
# zone gives 1.5 by 10), 356 and 361 units. On the bench (rts-headless
# bench-teams 18000 8 huge), 126 a side by 10 minutes and the sim at 0.7 ms
# a tick.
at 7200 expect blue extractors >= 50
at 7200 expect red extractors >= 50
at 7200 expect blue units >= 300
at 7200 expect red units >= 300
